---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";import cats from "../data/categories.json";import words from "../data/vocabulary.json";
---
<MainLayout>
<main class="container">
<section class="hero mt-8 grid items-center gap-8 px-7 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] md:px-14 md:py-16">
<div><div class="eyebrow">MEDIA PEMBELAJARAN BAHASA ARAB</div><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#173f35] md:text-5xl">Belajar kosakata bahasa Arab <span class="text-[#bd8c38]">dengan mudah.</span></h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-lg leading-7 text-[#66766d]">Kenali kata, pahami makna, dengarkan pelafalan, dan uji kemampuanmu melalui latihan interaktif.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/vocabulary/" class="btn-primary">Mulai belajar →</a><a href="/quiz/" class="btn-secondary">Coba kuis</a></div></div>
<div class="rounded-[28px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#dfeee0] to-[#f8ebd0] p-8 text-center"><div class="text-8xl">📖</div><div class="arabic mt-2 text-4xl text-[#164e42]">اللُّغَةُ العَرَبِيَّةُ</div><p class="mt-2 font-bold text-[#536c5c]">Bahasa Arab untuk pemula</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-3 text-3xl"><span>🔊</span><span>🖼️</span><span>🎯</span></div></div>
</section>
<section class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 py-8 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="card p-4"><b class="text-2xl text-[#164e42]">120</b><p class="text-xs muted">Kosakata awal</p></div><div class="card p-4"><b class="text-2xl text-[#164e42]">12</b><p class="text-xs muted">Kategori</p></div><div class="card p-4"><b class="text-2xl text-[#164e42]">24/7</b><p class="text-xs muted">Belajar mandiri</p></div><div class="card p-4"><b class="text-2xl text-[#164e42]">Gratis</b><p class="text-xs muted">Tanpa akun</p></div></section>
<section class="py-10"><div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3"><div><div class="eyebrow">PILIH TOPIK</div><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold">Kategori kosakata</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm muted">Mulai dari tema yang dekat dengan kehidupan sehari-hari.</p></div><a class="text-sm font-bold text-[#164e42]" href="/vocabulary/">Lihat semua →</a></div>
<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{cats.map(c=><a href={`/categories/${c.slug}/`} class="card p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="category-icon">{c.icon}</div><div class="arabic mt-4 text-2xl">{c.arabic}</div><h3 class="mt-2 font-bold">{c.name}</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm muted">{c.description}</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#164e42]">{words.filter(w=>w.category===c.slug).length} kosakata →</p></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="mb-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#173f35] px-7 py-9 text-white md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-10"><div><div class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest text-amber-300">UJI PEMAHAMAN</div><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold">Sudah siap menguji ingatanmu?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-emerald-100/75">Kerjakan kuis singkat dan lihat hasil belajarmu.</p></div><a href="/quiz/" class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3 font-bold text-[#164e42] md:mt-0">Mulai kuis →</a></section>
</main></MainLayout>